empt-error-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-candidates.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-attempt-error-signal-contract.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-accepted-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-provisional-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-rejected-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-review-queue.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-validator.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Represented rows: 3530\n- Source layer entries: 3530\n- Source semantic assertions: 3\n- Source blocked_quarantined entries: 3527\n- Source misconception/attempt-error candidates: 0\n- Candidate mappings: 0\n- Accepted mappings: 0\n- Provisional mappings: 0\n- Rejected mappings: 0\n- Review queue tasks: 0\n- Validator checks: 14 pass / 0 fail\n- External model/API calls: 0\n\n## Safety Boundaries\n\n- Misconception and attempt-error predicates are high-risk by default.\n- Raw/candidate-hold candidates route to review, not accepted/provisional runtime truth.\n- `blocked_quarantined` is terminal and cannot be revived by confidence.\n- One attempt-error signal cannot become a definitive misconception mapping.\n- Accepted fixture path requires strong evidence, provenance/evidence bundle, validator pass, human review state, and explicit misconception accepted gate.\n- No live student attempt ingestion, personalized learner model update, deterministic diagnosis wording, Supabase mutation, frontend work, external model call, or production RAG reindex.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.mjs --write` -> pass, validation_status `pass`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.test.js` -> pass, 9/9 tests\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.mjs` -> pass\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.test.js` -> pass\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-misconception-attempt-error-layer.test.js` -> pass\n- `git diff --check` -> pass\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> warning only: branch naming and expected dirty staged/new files before commit; workflow guards healthy\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T04:34:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T04:37:10Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T04:36:21Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T04:36:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"ee920a9c9c0134ef69a3ad3ec8c9078463e2e414","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1355/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1355/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1355/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/01b7676746fd13256b40b0acb1d19150ec47f8ba","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1328","ref":"feat/issue-1328","sha":"01b7676746fd13256b40b0acb1d19150ec47f8ba","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/follo